// A compact browser-player story with one semantic pattern draw and two endings.
pattern signals {
    signs: [
        (name: "Foxfire", meaning: hidden_path),
        (name: "Bell Glass", meaning: clear_warning),
        (name: "Moth Wing", meaning: patient_change),
    ]
    draw: uniform
}

VAR signal = signals.draw()

=== start ===
The hilltop observatory wakes beneath a sky of moving ink. The dial marks {signal.name}: {signal.meaning}.

* [Follow the signal]
    You turn the brass wheel. A thin road of light opens beyond the dome.
    -> END

* [Close the night log]
    You record the sign, shutter the lens, and leave the stars to their patient work.
    -> END
